#. module: ssi_dashboard_item_kpi
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_dashboard_item_kpi.field_dashboard_item__kpi_layout
msgid ""
"Arrangement the browser renders this KPI in. Only used when 'Type' is 'KPI'."
" 'KPI With Target' compares 'Value' against today's target (see 'Goal Type' "
"/ '_get_goal_value') and requires 'Goal Type' to be set to something other "
"than 'No Target'. 'Data Comparison' compares 'Value' against the first "
"comparison range of 'Data Source', and requires 'Data Source''s 'Comparison'"
" to be set to something other than 'No Comparison'."
msgstr ""

